    "title": "Portland man who killed roommate before setting her on fire found guilty - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aimee Plante ,\n4 hours ago PORTLAND, Ore. (KOIN) – A trial for the Portland man accused of a murder connected to a house fire ended in a guilty verdict from a Clackamas County jury on Wednesday. Bobby Lee Grady Alsup III, 31, is guilty of killing 31-year-old Kaley Ann Snow in March 2024, hiding her body in a shed, and then returning days later to set fire to the building. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
